<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<%# Security: restrict resource loading to same-origin; inline styles needed for CSS custom-property overrides %>
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy"
      content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none';">
<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<title><%= item[:title] || 'Tarot de Marseille' %></title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheet.css">
</head>
<body>

<div class="colorbars">
  <span class="cb-y"></span>
  <span class="cb-r"></span>
  <span class="cb-b"></span>
  <span class="cb-g"></span>
  <span class="cb-f"></span>
</div>

<header class="masthead">
  <div class="masthead-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow">
      <span class="regmark"><span class="dot"></span></span>
      Reader's Reference
      <span class="rule"></span>
      78 cards
    </div>
    <h1 class="title display">Tarot de <em>Marseille</em></h1>
    <p class="subtitle">All 78 cards — Major Arcana imagery, all 40 pip cards, all 16 court cards, plus suit domains and the pochoir-stencil color code of the classic French deck.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="toc" aria-label="Page sections">
  <div class="toc-inner">
    <a href="#majors">Majors</a>
    <a href="#suits">Suits</a>
    <a href="#numbers">Pip Cards</a>
    <a href="#courts">Court Cards</a>
    <a href="#colors">Colors</a>
    <a href="#notes">Reading Notes</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<main>
  <%= yield %>
</main>

<footer>
  <span class="regmark"><span class="dot"></span></span>
  Tarot de Marseille — Reader's Cheat Sheet
</footer>

</body>
</html>
